# Files that support developing this extension but have no business being
# copied into every project that installs it. Patterns are gitignore-
# compatible; `specify extension add` applies this file at install time.
#
# Without this file, the installer copies the extension's source directory
# verbatim, including dev-only files never declared in extension.yml's
# `provides:` — that previously shipped this repo's own tests/ and
# .claude/ (including local, machine-specific agent settings) into every
# consumer project.
tests/
.claude/
